OL,3,AEleanor Donaldson to appeal trial of
OL,4,Athe facts verdict
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleanor Donaldson has applied to appeal
OL,7,Fthe verdict from her trial of the
OL,8,Ffacts, which found she had done the
OL,9,Facts in relation to all five charges
OL,10,Fshe faced.
OL,12,FFour of those charges were of aiding
OL,13,Fand abetting the offending committed by
OL,14,Fher husband Jeffrey Donaldson.
OL,16,FThe former Democratic Unionist Party
OL,17,F(DUP) leader was convicted of 18 counts
OL,18,Fof sex abuse, including one count of
OL,19,Frape, which he committed against two
OL,20,Fwomen when they were children.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
