OL,3,AEleanor Donaldson to appeal trial of
OL,4,Athe facts verdict
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Courts Service
OL,7,Fconfirmed on Thursday that an
OL,8,Fapplication for leave to appeal had
OL,9,Fbeen lodged to the Court of Appeal by
OL,10,FEleanor Donaldson's legal team.
